### Prevent duplicate shortcut execution (4/6)

**Severity:** `high`

Clear the embedded context menu's open-state flag when the flyout closes. Otherwise, the context menu can keep consuming global shortcuts after it is no longer visible. Apply all suggestions in this group together.

```suggestion
    }

